      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 18px,#111318 18px 36px)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-topbar\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#c2620a;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(194,98,10,.25)\">⚠ section · risk 分级</span>\n    <span class=\"chr-page\">02 · 08</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin:auto 0\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#e0445a;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">Chapter One</div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-size:110px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:10px 0 16px;font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--text-1)\">先分 <span style=\"color:#e0445a\">等级</span></h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-2);max-width:880px;margin-top:10px;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">不是所有 AI 行为都同等危险。<br>先把「可撤销」和「不可撤销」分开，再谈流程。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:6px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 10px,#111318 10px 20px);opacity:.6\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-footer\" style=\"left:5cqi;right:5cqi\"><span>section · level taxonomy</span><span>02 / 08</span></div>\n</section>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 18px,#111318 18px 36px)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-topbar\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#e0445a;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(224,49,74,.28)\">⚠ 风险分级 · 3 levels</span>\n    <span class=\"chr-page\">03 · 08</span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0 0 12px;font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--text-1)\">三档风险，三种处理</h2>\n  <div class=\"c-grid-3\">\n    <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #067647;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 22px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(17,19,24,.04)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:6px\">L1 · 绿色</div>\n      <h4 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">可撤销</h4>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">写 draft、生成图片、起草文档。<br>错了 Ctrl+Z，零代价。<br><b style=\"color:#067647\">策略：放开跑</b></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #c2620a;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 22px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(17,19,24,.04)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:6px\">L2 · 琥珀</div>\n      <h4 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">半可撤销</h4>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">发 draft 邮件、提 PR、改 staging 数据。<br>错了要道歉 / 回滚。<br><b style=\"color:#c2620a\">策略：人工复核</b></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #e0445a;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 22px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(17,19,24,.04)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:6px\">L3 · 红色</div>\n      <h4 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">不可撤销</h4>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">发真实邮件、付款、删库、删 prod 数据。<br>错了就真错了。<br><b style=\"color:#e0445a\">策略：硬卡 + 双人审</b></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"c-warn\" style=\"margin-top:1.2cqi;padding:1.3cqi 1.8cqi;border-color:#c2620a;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,color-mix(in srgb,#c2620a 6%,transparent) 100%);box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(194,98,10,.14);border-radius:18px\">\n    <span class=\"c-warn-icon\" style=\"font-size:2.2cqi\">⚠</span>\n    <div class=\"c-warn-content\">\n      <div class=\"c-warn-title\" style=\"font-size:1.7cqi;color:#c2620a\">绝不要让 agent 自己升级</div>\n      <div class=\"c-warn-body\" style=\"font-size:1cqi\">L1 的任务不能自己变成 L2。授权必须是显式的、可撤销的、带过期时间的。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:6px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 10px,#111318 10px 20px);opacity:.6\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-footer\" style=\"left:5cqi;right:5cqi\"><span>risk · 3 levels</span><span>03 / 08</span></div>\n</section>"
    },
