      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 18px,#111318 18px 36px)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-topbar\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#c2620a;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(194,98,10,.25)\">⚠ incident report · q1</span>\n    <span class=\"chr-page\">05 · 08</span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--text-1)\">我们 Q1 的 <span style=\"color:#e0445a\">12 起 AI 事故</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-2);max-width:880px;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">幸好全部捕获在 staging。但每一起都能上生产。</p>\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1040 340\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:1040px;margin-top:14px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <g font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#4a4955\">\n      <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#eaecf3\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"200\" width=\"60\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#067647\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"140\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#d97706\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"110\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e0314a\"/>\n        <text x=\"30\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Jan</text>\n        <text x=\"30\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#14141a\">5</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(320,0)\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"220\" width=\"60\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#067647\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"180\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#d97706\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"160\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#e0314a\"/>\n        <text x=\"30\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Feb</text>\n        <text x=\"30\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#14141a\">3</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(520,0)\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"230\" width=\"60\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#067647\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"200\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#d97706\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"190\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#e0314a\"/>\n        <text x=\"30\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Mar</text>\n        <text x=\"30\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#14141a\">4</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(720,50)\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#e0314a\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">L3 不可撤销 (3)</text>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"26\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#d97706\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"39\" font-weight=\"700\">L2 需复核 (4)</text>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#067647\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"65\" font-weight=\"700\">L1 可恢复 (5)</text>\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#8a8892\">全部被 safety-policy 在 runtime 拦下，</text>\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#8a8892\">未进 prod。但 3 起 L3 非常惊险。</text>\n      </g>\n    </g>\n  </svg>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:6px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 10px,#111318 10px 20px);opacity:.6\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-footer\" style=\"left:5cqi;right:5cqi\"><span>incident · q1 summary</span><span>05 / 08</span></div>\n</section>"
