mily:var(--font-sans)\">不要信 prompt 里的 \"be careful\"，要信执行层的硬卡。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 22px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(17,19,24,.04)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:6px\">3 · kill switch</div>\n      <h4 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">红按钮<br>能在 2 秒内停</h4>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.55;font-family:var(--font-sans)\">CTO / on-call 都得知道怎么按。演练一次。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"c-warn\" style=\"margin-top:1.2cqi;padding:1.3cqi 1.8cqi;border-color:#067647;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,color-mix(in srgb,#067647 6%,transparent) 100%);box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(6,118,71,.14);border-radius:18px\">\n    <span class=\"c-warn-icon\" style=\"font-size:2.2cqi;color:#067647\">✓</span>\n    <div class=\"c-warn-content\">\n      <div class=\"c-warn-title\" style=\"font-size:1.7cqi;color:#067647\">真正的安全不是 prompt，是流程</div>\n      <div class=\"c-warn-body\" style=\"font-size:1cqi\">prompt 会被注入，流程不会。—— 把保护放在不可被说服的一层。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:6px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#e0445a 0 10px,#111318 10px 20px);opacity:.6\"></div>\n  <div class=\"chr-footer\" style=\"left:5cqi;right:5cqi\"><span>cta · tonight</span><span>07 / 08</span></div>\n</section>"
